INSTRS    EQU    $4BAD                    ; instruments, 60 bytes each (RAM) [wavetable]
WOFF      EQU    $6E95                    ; wave tables built by MAKEWAVES (RAM)
WSINE2    EQU    $6F95
WSINE4    EQU    $7095
WSAW2     EQU    $7195
WSAW4     EQU    $7295
WTRI2     EQU    $7395
WTRI4     EQU    $7495
WPULSE    EQU    $7595
WPULSE2   EQU    $7695
WPULSE4   EQU    $7795
